sec.p:
To investigate whether genetic control within a species influences the epigenetic aging rates measured by pan-mammalian clocks, we used human pedigree data from the FHS. Pedigree-based polygenic models of epigenetic age, adjusted for age and sex, yielded significant narrow-sense heritability estimates for clock 2 (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
